Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.32,0:00:07.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已經入秋啦
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.97,0:00:10.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,賞月 萬聖節 運動會
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.52,0:00:12.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有好多“第一次” 好期待
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.75,0:00:15.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這種時期會變得乾燥 不太喜歡
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.15,0:00:19.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對喔 妳從以前就是這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,做好保暖
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.35,0:00:23.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以緩解一定程度的乾燥喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啟動暖氣功能
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.22,0:00:34.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 謝謝
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,錯誤
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.77,0:00:42.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,錯誤
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.87,0:00:45.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,偵測到異常電流
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.37,0:00:48.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪醬想成為家人）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.30,0:02:20.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:26.42,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（“AMANE - GO！”）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.22,0:02:25.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之應該沒什麼重大故障
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過足以傷害到阿爾瑪的電擊
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,到底是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道是靜電？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說啥傻話
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已排查各種狀況與資料
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是靜電
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.82,0:02:43.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可能是媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從小一直接觸精密儀器
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.80,0:02:51.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再加上自身的體質
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.10,0:02:54.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因此帶上了強烈的電氣
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是… 是這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,的確最近
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.40,0:03:02.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,身邊的機器總是壞掉
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是阿爾瑪的耐電性能也很強
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人類的這一點電流應該…
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿… 阿爾瑪？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,根據自動防衛系統的判斷
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.82,0:03:30.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,與媽媽的接觸
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.55,0:03:32.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,屬於“危險”！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,危險？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.77,0:03:36.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,危險物品
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是危險物品
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.77,0:03:40.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請放心
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.02,0:03:43.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也會盡全力解決的
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.27,0:03:45.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這種距離感好難受
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.02,0:03:48.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為這點事就喪氣的話
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有辱工學界的才女
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夜羽雀的威名！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.57,0:03:56.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我記得實驗室還有剩下的絕緣材料
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.05,0:04:01.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我來幫忙
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是在做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.80,0:04:17.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,發生了這種事
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.87,0:04:19.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇 好方便
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.22,0:04:22.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,肌膚乾燥和靜電嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我知道好辦法喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.37,0:04:32.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,充足的睡眠 適當運動
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.17,0:04:33.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,營養均衡的飲食
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.32,0:04:36.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要肌膚健康
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就能改善乾燥狀況喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.37,0:04:42.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已經不行了…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.35,0:04:46.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來 補充水分
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.92,0:04:49.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣做真的能夠
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,改善體質嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.77,0:04:52.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不愧是小時姑姑
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是我們沒想到的觀點
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為乾燥是肌膚的大敵啊
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.17,0:05:02.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽平時就狂吃甜食
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,熬夜還長期缺乏運動
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一直都讓人很擔心
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.27,0:05:09.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是改善現狀的好機會
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.10,0:05:11.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-知道了\N-哼！哼！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.17,0:05:16.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有壓力也是大敵
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.42,0:05:17.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好羨慕
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對我來說 不能碰機械
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是最大的壓力
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,碰觸喜歡的事物
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才是最棒的消除壓力方式啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.22,0:05:34.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒空消沉了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要做所有能嘗試的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:43.82,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（小雀 體質改善計畫）
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.07,0:05:40.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.42,0:05:44.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀的體質改善計畫開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.17,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（蛋包飯 沙拉）
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,健康的飲食
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,運動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.12,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,（功效 保濕 肌膚乾燥）
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.12,0:05:51.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,肌膚保養
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀因宅在家而不健康的身體
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,變得驚人的健康
Dialogue: 2,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一個月後
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.60,0:06:19.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為什麼啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:20.47,0:06:21.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟之前相比
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.87,0:06:23.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,靜電反而變得更強了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,累積了壓力
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓靜電變得更強烈
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒救了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.50,0:06:35.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都這麼努力了…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,重新詳細檢查至今為止的情報
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.97,0:06:40.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.65,0:06:42.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知道什麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請緊緊擁抱媽媽！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.62,0:06:47.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為啥啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是最佳方法
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人類只要碰觸喜歡的人或動物
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.72,0:06:56.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像會分泌能緩解壓力的賀爾蒙
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.62,0:07:00.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這表示只要爸爸碰觸媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.45,0:07:02.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就有可能產生
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.70,0:07:04.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,類似擁抱我的效果！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.07,0:07:06.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳是說真的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.22,0:07:08.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.47,0:07:10.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她會討厭這樣做吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.07,0:07:11.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.02,0:07:13.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隨便你摸！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連妳也在胡言亂語嗎！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.00,0:07:21.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是阿爾瑪特地找來的方法
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.62,0:07:23.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還沒有嘗試所有方法
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我不想就這樣輕易放棄！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.65,0:07:27.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也是…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是妳一直這麼情緒低落的話
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也覺得不習慣
Dialogue: 2,0:07:33.70,0:07:36.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是具體要怎麼做…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,根據資料
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.77,0:07:41.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,刺激催產素分泌的有效方式是
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.27,0:07:44.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,撫摸 牽手
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.97,0:07:45.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,接吻或性…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.50,0:07:46.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就撫摸吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯！用撫摸！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:49.20,0:07:49.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隨時放馬過來！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.22,0:07:52.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.32,0:07:56.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:56.72,0:07:57.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.65,0:07:58.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.85,0:07:59.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.57,0:08:00.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請快點進行
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.07,0:08:02.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:05.47,0:08:06.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,欸 啊… 抱歉！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我馬上放手！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.52,0:08:23.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,確認兩位血液中的催產素濃度已增加
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.47,0:08:24.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.55,0:08:27.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請維持剛才的姿勢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是要維持多久…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.02,0:08:50.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才行啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隔天
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 好軟…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來已經沒事了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.90,0:09:05.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 效果非常好
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,後來發生了什麼呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:12.42,0:09:14.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:22.80,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已清除危險要素
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,家人關係也很良好
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,做得很好
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.40,0:09:28.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,終於到了這一刻呢
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,表示我們很厲害啊
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸媽媽和小時姑姑
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.15,0:09:34.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有大家好像都來觀賞了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我們上場吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,用滿臉笑容！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓最棒的歡樂！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.47,0:09:43.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遍布整個世界
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.60,0:09:45.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,送給大家！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:46.22,0:09:48.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,AMANE GO！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:53.42,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（一個月前…）
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.47,0:09:56.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜 妮恩
Dialogue: 2,0:09:58.47,0:09:59.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我爆紅了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.10,0:10:01.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個是…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.15,0:10:04.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是工地現場的重型機械爺爺們！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來這個場面
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,被別人上傳到網路了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是個好機會！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.97,0:10:12.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把這部影片當作起點
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們來做網路播送吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,網路播送？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.55,0:10:18.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們沃茲尼亞克
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,旗下的娛樂事業還很薄弱
Dialogue: 2,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了增長見識
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.47,0:10:23.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想不依靠公司的力量
Dialogue: 2,0:10:24.27,0:10:27.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嘗試網路播送者的工作
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像很好玩！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然決定了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.75,0:10:33.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,首先需要團體名稱呢
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,適合我們的
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.37,0:10:36.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既可愛
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.42,0:10:38.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,又充滿故事性的好聽名稱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:51.60,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（MaANe MAKINA ALMA NEON）
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就用名字的第一個字發音
Dialogue: 2,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,叫做MAANE不就好了？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要排第一個！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太隨便了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,MAANE AMANE…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.45,0:10:58.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,調換了順序
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,AMANE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:06.87,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（遍）
Dialogue: 2,0:11:01.52,0:11:04.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在日語中有“廣泛傳播” “流轉”
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和“滋潤”等幾個意思
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很棒啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.45,0:11:10.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊 好耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:16.60,0:11:18.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,AMANE開始活動！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.90,0:11:21.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,AMANE頻道！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,網路播送團體？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.40,0:11:28.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是類似微笑電影
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,或TikTak之類的東西嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:30.95,0:11:31.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這不是很好嗎！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很厲害吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真高興能得到您的贊同
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,發表各種傾向的影片
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,同時觀察反應
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.00,0:11:42.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,規劃下個方案 做起來很有成就感
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,某方面來說很適合妳啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.15,0:11:48.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,網路播送現在已是競爭激烈的市場
Dialogue: 2,0:11:49.42,0:11:50.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,必須時刻面對各種數據
Dialogue: 2,0:11:50.97,0:11:52.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,即使犧牲睡眠也要活動
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幾乎沒有私生活
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果不能享受發表作品就無法勝任
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.07,0:11:59.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是充滿荊棘的道路喔
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.82,0:12:00.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請放心吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.55,0:12:03.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你好像懂很多嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才… 才沒有
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過如果是阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,應該不會發生奇怪的事
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.97,0:12:12.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那接下來
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之先脫衣服吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等 等一下 等一下！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為啥要脫衣服？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在網路上只要露越多
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像就能引來更多注意
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不對不對 這可不行！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然的確有這方面的資料
Dialogue: 2,0:12:25.67,0:12:27.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但太過強調性方面的話
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.15,0:12:28.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會被封鎖喔
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.22,0:12:31.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此 那就不脫了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來還是注意一下她的行為比較好
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.30,0:12:35.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:38.57,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（去公園玩耍 超激烈盪鞦韆對決）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:36.97,0:12:38.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,A-Ma-Ne頻道！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.10,0:12:42.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天是在附近的公園拍攝喔
Dialogue: 2,0:12:42.95,0:12:44.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個還蠻好玩的耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很好玩
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,兩個人都很可愛呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:50.90,0:12:53.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 來比比看誰能盪得比較高
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.55,0:12:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對決吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:54.55,0:12:55.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.77,0:12:57.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很危險喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.82,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（乖孩子不要模仿喔！A-Ma-Ne頻道）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.17,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（不見了？咦？）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.20,0:13:08.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:11.05,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（厲害 強 剛才好扯 剛才那是啥）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.30,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（盪鞦韆對決 在公園玩耍\N#A-Ma-Ne #小學生 #熱門 #可愛\N挑戰各種事 製作有趣影片）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.72,0:13:14.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小小紅了一下呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來做更好玩的事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.85,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（小學生戰鬥 試著戰鬥了）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.05,0:13:18.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,A-Ma-Ne頻道！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,認真一點啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:22.55,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（互推 沒在戰鬥啊 哪裡像戰鬥 是相撲嗎）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.05,0:13:21.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:13:25.77,0:13:27.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咳咳… 哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:29.90,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（小學生 試著飛翔了）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.97,0:13:29.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,A-Ma-Ne頻道！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:33.17,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（CGZ 好假喔 AI生成 好想飛 是合成吧 好像很舒服）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:30.30,0:13:32.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,風景超美呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:34.67,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（A-Ma-Ne試著飛翔了\N#A-Ma-Ne #小學生 #熱門 #可愛\N挑戰各種事 製作有趣影片）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.05,0:13:36.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有很多留言喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為被當成是CG
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.07,0:13:40.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,評價很低啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:41.05,0:13:43.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,訂閱者增加了喔
Dialogue: 2,0:13:44.75,0:13:47.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪她們在做網路播送啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀姊有跟我說
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.37,0:13:51.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有三萬人在看呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.97,0:13:54.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是訂閱者數量
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.17,0:13:56.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是觀眾數量
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.37,0:13:57.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是喔
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近好像常在那附近
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聚在一起玩
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然對我而說 只要不吵就好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳的表情是什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:10.45,0:14:11.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗷！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.35,0:14:13.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好 卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.10,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（A-Ma-Ne頻道）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.65,0:14:16.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,發射！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.57,0:14:20.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,進步很多了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:21.12,0:14:23.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,希望能讓更多人看到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.55,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（A-Ma-Ne試著飛翔了）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算去飛翔或發射光束
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.07,0:14:29.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都被說成是CG
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉呀妳們兩個
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有很多可以改進的地方呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:37.55,0:14:39.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,比如說反應！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.35,0:14:43.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算是吃一樣的料理
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超好吃的啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.85,0:14:46.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要一個反應
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,印象就會大不同呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪的話
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.67,0:14:51.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,反應再誇張一點
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.97,0:14:53.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說不定會有好效果呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.15,0:14:54.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我試試看
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.60,0:14:56.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.45,0:14:59.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請做點會嚇到我的事
Dialogue: 2,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看我的！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:02.70,0:15:03.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哈！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:10.42,0:15:11.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼樣呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.87,0:15:14.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讚！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:17.30,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（A-Ma-Ne頻道 來賓 小時姑姑 試著畫畫了）
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.55,0:15:16.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,A-Ma-Ne頻道
Dialogue: 2,0:15:19.37,0:15:21.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:25.32,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哇 繞了一大圈\N連驚訝方式都變詭異了 簡直是天才）
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,出乎意料大受歡迎
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 2,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,網路生態真難懂
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.62,0:15:31.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣不是很好嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.82,0:15:35.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近收看阿爾瑪她們的人也變多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:42.50,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（A-Ma-Ne頻道 來賓 小時姑姑 試著畫畫了\N挑戰各種事 製作有趣影片）
Dialogue: 2,0:15:36.42,0:15:38.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,目前訂閱者有五萬人
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總覺得… 莫名高興呢
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,笑什麼啦
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.10,0:15:47.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你才是咧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會更努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.60,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（睡衣直播！）
Dialogue: 2,0:15:51.52,0:15:53.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,A-Ma-Ne頻道！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:53.95,0:15:56.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這次是應大家的要求
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.05,0:15:59.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,進行睡衣直播！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:59.37,0:16:00.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來決定主題吧！
